==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Germanic|durzanan|lang=ang}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|dʰers-|lang=ang}}.  Cognate with Old Frisian ''dūra'', Icelandic [[þora]]; (West Frisian [[doare]]), Old High German [[giturran]], Old Saxon [[durran]] and [[gidurran]] and with Greek [[θαρσειν]] ‘be bold’.

